>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065ff" class=3D"confluenceTh">Health service=
 number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">not available</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Health Insurance number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Denmark Health Insurance Number ma=
tches a valid health insurance number combined with any of the following ke=
ywords within a proximity of 10 terms: sundhedsd=C3=A6kning, sundhedsfordel=
e, sundhedsplejeordning, personligt sundhedsnummer, sundhedsregistrering, s=
undhedsforsikringsnummer, CPR-number, CPR number (or) sundhedslov. (All ter=
ms case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{6}[-]?\d{4}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:sundhedsd[=C3=A6ae]kning|sundhedsfordele|=
sundhedsplejeordning|personligt sundhedsnummer|sundhedsregistrering|sundhed=
sforsikringsnummer|CPR-number|CPR number|sundhedslov)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span data-colorid=3D"budj89yc55">123456-8769</s=
pan></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ti=
tle=3D"Background color :">Date of birth&nbsp;</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">(?i)(?:f=
[=C3=B8o]dselsdato|f[=C3=B8o]dt|f[=C3=B8o]dselsdag|f[=C3=B8o]dt den|f[=C3=
=B8o]dsels[=C3=A5a]r|f[=C3=B8o]d-dag|f-dag)</span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#36b37e" class=3D"confluenceTh">Phone number</=
th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#de350b" class=3D"confluenceTh">Physical addre=
ss</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#36b37e" class=3D"confluenceTh">Post code</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">License plate number (i.e. vehicle=
)</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br>
Denmark License Plate Number matches a valid license plate number combined =
with any of the following keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: bilregis=
trering, indregistreringsnummer, nummerpladeregistrering, nummerplade. (All=
 terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">[A-Z]{2}[ ]?\d{2}[ ]?\d{3}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:bilregistrering|indregistreringsnummer|nu=
mmerpladeregistrering|nummerplade)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">AA 12 345</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#de350b" class=3D"confluenceTh">Person name</t=
h>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#36b37e" class=3D"confluenceTh">IBAN</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Bank account number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Denmark Bank Account Number matche=
s a valid bank account number combined with any of the following keywords w=
ithin a proximity of 10 terms: bankkontonummer, bankoplysninger, banknummer=
, kontoregistrering, konto-id, kontonummer, registreringsnummer, reg. numme=
r (or) nummereret konto. (All terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{10}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:bankkontonummer|bankoplysninger|banknumme=
r|kontoregistrering|konto-id|kontonummer|registreringsnummer|reg\. nummer|n=
ummereret konto)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">0440116243</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ti=
tle=3D"Background color :">Credit card number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">(?i)(?:b=
ankkort|kreditkortnummer|kreditkort|pengeautomat|korttype|kreditkortnr\.?|c=
vv-kode)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Routing number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Denmark Routing Number matches a v=
alid routing number combined with any of the following keywords within a pr=
oximity of 10 terms: overf=C3=B8rselsnr., bankoverf=C3=B8rselsnr., overf=C3=
=B8rselsnummer, CPR-number, CPR number (or) RTN. (All terms case insensitiv=
e; diacritics are optional.)<br><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{9}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:overf[=C3=B8o]rselsnr\.|bankoverf[=C3=B8o=
]rselsnr\.|overf[=C3=B8o]rselsnummer|CPR-number|CPR number|RTN)<span class=
=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">123456789</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Business number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Denmark Business Number matches a =
valid business number combined with any of the following keywords within a =
proximity of 10 terms: virksomhedsnr., virksomhedsnummer, virksomhedsregist=
reringsnummer, reg.nr.,&nbsp; virksomhedsreg.nr., virksomheds-id (or) regis=
treringsnr.<span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3"> (All terms case insensi=
tive.)</span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span data-colorid=3D"quk8p11j4e">(?i)(DK)? ?\d{=
8}|(((DK)? ?\d{2} )(\d{2} ){2}\d{2})</span></td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:virksomhedsnr\.|virksomhedsnummer|virksom=
hedsregistreringsnummer|reg\.nr\.|virksomheds-id|virksomhedsreg\.nr\.|regis=
treringsnr)<span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=
=3D\W|$))</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">DK12345678</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Company number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Denmark Company Number matches a v=
alid company number combined with any of the following keywords within a pr=
oximity of 10 terms: dansk virksomhedsnr., dansk virksomhedsnummer, selskab=
s-id-nummer, dansk virksomhedsregistreringsnummer, Det Centrale Virksomheds=
register nummer, virksomhedsnummer, forretningsnummer, CVR-nummer, CVR numm=
er (or) selskabsnummer. (All terms case insensitive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span data-colorid=3D"dr71t6m7p3">(?i)(DK)? ?\d{=
8}|(((DK)? ?\d{2} )(\d{2} ){2}\d{2})</span></td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:dansk virksomhedsnr\.|dansk virksomhedsnu=
mmer|selskabs-id-nummer|dansk virksomhedsregistreringsnummer|Det Centrale V=
irksomhedsregister nummer|virksomhedsnummer|forretningsnummer|CVR-nummer|CV=
R nummer|selskabsnummer)<span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">(?:\b|(?&lt=
;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">DK12345678</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
