</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#ff991f" rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">=
National Identity Card Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">India National ID Number matches a=
 valid National Identity Card Number with any of the following keywords wit=
hin a proximity of 10 terms: Aadhar (or) Voter ID. (All terms case insensit=
ive.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">(([2-9]\=
d{3}[- ]?\d{4}[ -]?\d{4})|[A-Z]{3}\d{7})</span></td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
