adhar|Voter ID)</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">95685842=
1589, XGN3002623</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065ff" class=3D"confluenceTh">CPF number</th=
>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">not available</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#36b37e" class=3D"confluenceTh">Passport numbe=
r</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#ff991f" rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">=
Driver License Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-b=
lue3">India Driver's License Number matches a valid license number with any=
 of the following keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: DVLA, photocard =
licence, learner drivers, licence holder, licence holders, licence number, =
license number, driving licences, driving licenses, driving licence, drivin=
g license, driver's licence, driver's license, drivers licence (or) drivers=
 license. (All terms case insensitive.)</span></td>
<td style=3D"margin-left: 40.0px;" class=3D"confluenceTd">(D[DLN]|G[AJ]|H[P=
R]|J[HK]|K[AL]|L[AD]|M[HLNPZ]|NL|O[DRT]|P[BY]|RJ|SK|T[NRS]|U[KAP]|WB|H[PR]|=
A[NPRS]|BR|C[GH])[- ]?(\d{2}[ -]?\d{4}[ -]?\d{7})|(\d{2}[\/]\d{3}[\/]\d{4})=
</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">(?i)(?:D=
VLA|photocard licence|learner drivers|licence holder|licence holders|licenc=
e number|license number|driving licences|driving licenses|driving licence|d=
riving license|driver\'s licence|driver\'s license|drivers licence|drivers =
license)</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">KA50 201=
40010487, DL-0420110149646, MH-1220050000188, 11/525/2015, TS0091998000885<=
/span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065ff" class=3D"confluenceTh">Social Insuran=
ce Number - SIN</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">not available</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#ff991f" rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">=
Tax ID number (i.e. Taxpayer ID number)</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-b=
lue3">India Tax ID Number matches a valid Tax Identification Number with an=
y of the following keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: tax identificat=
ion number,&nbsp; tax id number,&nbsp; tax identity number, tax number, Tax=
 Identification Code, tax file, tax identification no, tax no#, tax no, tax=
 registration number, taxid#, taxidno#, taxidnumber#, taxno#, taxnumber#, t=
axnumber, tin id, tin no, tin#, TIN, tax id (or) tax file number. (All term=
s case insensitive.)</span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">([A-Z]{3=
}[CPHFATBLJG][A-Z]\d{4}[A-Z])</span></td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br>
RFC<br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">(?i)(?:t=
ax identification number|tax id number|tax identity number|tax number|Tax I=
dentification Code|tax file|tax identification no|tax no\#?|tax no|tax regi=
stration number|taxidno\#?|taxidnumber\#?|taxid\#?|taxno\#?|taxnumber\#?|ta=
xnumber|tin id|tin no|tin\#?|TIN|tax id|PAN)(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))=
</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">AAQCS425=
9Q</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ff991f" rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTd">=
<strong title=3D"">VAT number</strong></td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">India VAT ID Number matches a vali=
d value added tax identification number with any of the following keywords =
within a proximity of 10 terms: vat no., vat number, vat#, value added tax,=
 value added tax number, vat no (or) VAT. (All terms case insensitive.)</td=
>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">IN\d{13}[A-z]\d</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:value added tax number|vat number|value a=
dded tax|vat no|VAT|vat no\.?|vat\#?)<span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3=
">(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f4f5f7" class=3D"confluenceTd"><strong title=
=3D"">Example:</strong></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">IN1234567890123Z1</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065ff" class=3D"confluenceTh">Health service=
 number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
