<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:routingnummer|bankrouting\#?|routingnr\.?=
|routing\#?|RTN)<span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#]=
)(?=3D\W|$))</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">101111335</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065ff" class=3D"confluenceTh">Business numbe=
r</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">not available</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh"><strong>Organization Number</strong></th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Sweden Company Number - ON (Organi=
zation Number) matches a valid ON combined with any of the following keywor=
ds within a proximity of 10 terms: skt f=C3=B6retagsnr.#, skt f=C3=B6retags=
nummer, organisationsnummer, organisationsnr. (or) f=C3=B6retagsregistrerin=
gsnummer. (All terms case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{6}[ -]\d{4}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Organization number<br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><strong>Company Number</strong></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:skt f[=C3=B6o]retagsnr\.?\#?|skt f[=C3=B6=
o]retagsnummer|organisationsnummer|organisationsnr\.?|f[=C3=B6o]retagsregis=
treringsnummer)<span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])=
(?=3D\W|$))</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">556737-0431</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2 class=3D"auto-cursor-target" id=3D"Batch2Countries-Mexico"><strong>Mexi=
co</strong></h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table class=3D"wrapped relative-table confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 97.=
295%;">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 22.0987%;">
<col style=3D"width: 32.9746%;">
<col style=3D"width: 31.9312%;">
<col style=3D"width: 13.0525%;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Identifiers</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Descriptions</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Regex</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Note</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Social Security Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Mexico Social Security Number matc=
hes a valid SSN combined with any of the following keywords within a proxim=
ity of 10 terms: n=C3=BAmero de seguridad social =C2=BFn=C3=BAmero, n.=C2=
=B0 seguridad social, =C2=BFn=C3=BAmero de SSN, SSID (or) n=C3=BAmero de se=
guridad social.<span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3"> (All terms case ins=
ensitive; diacritics are optional.)</span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><span data-colorid=3D"j0jlj9q0so">(\d{2}?[- ]?\d{2}?[- ]?\d{2}?[ -]?\d{4=
}?[ -]?\d)|\d{11}</span></p></td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:n[=C3=BAu]mero de seguridad social( \=C2=
=BF?n=C3=BAmero)?|n\.?[o=C2=BA] seguridad social|\=C2=BF?n[=C3=BAu]mero de(=
 SSN)?|SSID|n[=C3=BAu]mero de seguridad social)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">12-12-12-1234-1</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#ff991f" class=3D"confluenceTh">National Ident=
ity Card Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Mexico National ID Number - CURP (=
Clave =C3=9Anica de Registro de Poblaci=C3=B3n) matches a valid CURP number=
 &nbsp;combined with any of the following keywords within a proximity of 10=
 terms: NSS, CURP, NIN =C2=BFn=C3=BAmero, n=C3=BAmero de tarjeta nacional, =
n=C3=BAmero de tarjeta de identidad nacional, identificaci=C3=B3n nacional =
(or) n=C3=BAmero de identificaci=C3=B3n nacional. (All terms case insensiti=
ve; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)[A-Z]{4}[0-9]{6}[HM][A-Z]{2}[B-DF-HJ-NP-TV-Z=
]{3}[A-Z0-9][0-9]</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">=
CURP</span></strong></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:n[=C3=BAu]mero de tarjeta nacional|n[=C3=
=BAu]mero de tarjeta de identidad nacional|identificaci[=C3=B3o]n nacional|=
n[=C3=BAu]mero de identificaci=C3=B3n nacional|NSS|CURP|NIN|=C2=BF?n[=C3=BA=
u]mero)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">HEGA8205=
06HBCRRL09, HEGJ820506HBCRRN09</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065ff" class=3D"confluenceTh">CPF number</th=
>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">not available</td>
</tr>
<tr>
