</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#ff991f" rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">=
Driver License Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-b=
lue3">Mexico Driver's License Number matches a valid license number combine=
d with any of the following keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: DVLA,&=
nbsp; licencia de tarjeta fotogr=C3=A1fica,&nbsp; conductores principiantes=
,&nbsp; titular de la licencia,&nbsp; titulares de la licencia,&nbsp; n=C3=
=BAmero de licencia,&nbsp; (or) licencia de conducir. (All terms case insen=
sitive; diacritics are optional.)</span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">(\d{9}|[=
A-Z]{3}\d{7}|[A-Z]\d{8})</span></td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:DVLA|licencia de tarjeta fotogr[a=C3=A1]f=
ica|conductores principiantes|titulares de la licencia|n[u=C3=BA]mero de li=
cencia|titular de la licencia|licencias de conducir|licencia de conducir)</=
td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">50930411=
4, GTO9753864, SON5980731, N10920822</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
