ce Number - SIN</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#ff991f" class=3D"confluenceTh">Tax ID number =
(i.e. Taxpayer ID number)</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Mexico Tax ID Number - RFC (Regist=
ro Federal de Contibuyentes Number) matches a valid RFC number combined wit=
h any of the following keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: n=C3=BAmero=
 de identificaci=C3=B3n fiscal, n=C3=BAmero de impuesto, c=C3=B3digo de ide=
ntificaci=C3=B3n fiscal, archivo fiscal, n=C3=BAmero de registro fiscal, n=
=C3=BAmero de identificaci=C3=B3n fiscal #, n=C3=BAmero de impuesto #, iden=
tificaci=C3=B3n de esta=C3=B1o, n=C3=BAmero de esta=C3=B1o, TIN (or) identi=
ficaci=C3=B3n de impuestos. (All terms case insensitive; diacritics are opt=
ional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">[A-z]{3,4}[ |\-]?[0-9]{6}[ |\-]?[0-9A-z]{3}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">RFC<br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">=
Registro Federal de Contibuyentes - RFC</span></strong></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">(?i)(?:n=
[u=C3=BA]mero de identificaci[o=C3=B3]n fiscal|n[u=C3=BA]mero de impuesto|c=
[o=C3=B3]digo de identificaci[o=C3=B3]n fiscal|archivo fiscal|n[u=C3=BA]mer=
o de registro fiscal|n[u=C3=BA]mero de identificaci[o=C3=B3]n fiscal \#?|n[=
u=C3=BA]mero de impuesto \#?|identificaci[o=C3=B3]n de esta[n=C3=B1]o|n[u=
=C3=BA]mero de esta[n=C3=B1]o|TIN|identificaci[o=C3=B3]n de impuestos)(?:\b=
|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">EFC92010=
213L</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065ff" class=3D"confluenceTh">VAT number</th=
>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">RFC</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065ff" class=3D"confluenceTh">Health service=
 number</th>
