<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ti=
tle=3D"Background color :">Date of birth</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">(?i) (?:=
 fecha de nacimiento | fecha de nacimiento | cumplea=C3=B1os | fecha de nac=
imiento | aniversario de nacimiento | d=C3=ADa de nacimiento | cumplea=C3=
=B1os | fecha de nacimiento)</span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#ff991f" rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">=
Phone number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-b=
lue3">Mexico Phone number matches an Mexican Phone number combined with any=
 of the following keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: n=C3=BAmero de t=
el=C3=A9fono, tel=C3=A9fono, &nbsp;n=C3=BAmero de m=C3=B3vil (or) n=C3=BAme=
ro de tel=C3=A9fono m=C3=B3vil. (All terms case insensitive; diacritics are=
 optional.)</span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(\+?52)?[ -]?\d{2,3}[ -]\d{3,4}[ -]\d{4}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:n[u=C3=BA]mero de tel[e=C3=A9]fono|n[u=C3=
=BA]mero de tel[e=C3=A9]fono m[o=C3=B3]vil|n[u=C3=BA]mero de m[o=C3=B3]vil|=
tel[e=C3=A9]fono)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">+52 551 254 5678,+52 55 1254 5678</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#de350b" class=3D"confluenceTh">Physical addre=
ss</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#ff991f" rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">=
Post code</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-b=
lue3">Mexico Postcode matches with Mexican postcode combined with any of th=
e following keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: 'direcci=C3=B3n, lugar=
 de residencia, ciudad, correo real, c=C3=B3digo abierto, c=C3=B3digo posta=
l distrito, c=C3=B3digo postal =C3=A1rea, c=C3=B3digo postal unidad, c=C3=
=B3digo postal sector (or) c=C3=B3digo postal. (All terms case insensitive;=
 diacritics are optional.)</span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">\d{5}([-=
]\d{2})?</span></td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">(?i)(?:d=
irecci[o=C3=B3]n|lugar de residencia|ciudad|correo real|c[o=C3=B3]digo abie=
rto|c[o=C3=B3]digo postaldistrito|c[o=C3=B3]digo postal [a=C3=A1]rea|c[o=C3=
=B3]digo postalunidad|c[o=C3=B3]digo postal sector|c[o=C3=B3]digo postal)</=
span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">66455,42=
039</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">License plate number (i.e. vehicle=
)</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Mexico License Plate Number matche=
s a valid license plate number combined with any of the following keywords =
within a proximity of 10 terms: matr=C3=ADcula, n.=C2=B0 de registro, n.=C2=
=B0 de matr=C3=ADcula,&nbsp; matr=C3=ADcula, n=C3=BAmero de licencia (or) n=
=C3=BAmero de matr=C3=ADcula n=C3=BAmero de registro.<span class=3D"legacy-=
color-text-blue3"> (All terms case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</=
span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">[A-Z]{3}[ -]?\d{2}[ -]?\d{2}|\d{2}[ -]?\d{2}[ -]=
?[A-Z]{3}|\d{3}[ -]?[A-Z]{3}([ -]?[A-Z])?|[A,0]{2,3}-[A,B,L-N,P,R-Z]A{2}(?!=
[IOQ][A-Z])</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:n\.?[o=C2=BA] de registro|n\.?[o=C2=BA] d=
e matr[=C3=ADi]cula|n[=C3=BAu]mero de licencia|n[=C3=BAu]mero de matr[=C3=
=ADi]cula|n[=C3=BAu]mero de registro|matr[=C3=ADi]cula)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">WLA-94-12,000-NAA</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#de350b" class=3D"confluenceTh">Person name</t=
h>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">IBAN</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Mexico International Bank Account =
Number - CLABE (Clave Bancaria Estandarizada) matches a valid CLABE number =
combined with any of the following keywords within a proximity of 10 terms:=
 N=C3=BAmero de cuenta bancaria internacional, CLABE, =C2=BFn=C3=BAmero de =
IBAN (or) Clave Bancaria Estandarizada Number.(All terms case insensitive; =
diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">0[0-47][0-2467]\d{3}\d{11}\d</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">CLABE<br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:N[=C3=BAu]mero de cuenta bancaria interna=
cional|CLABE|\=C2=BF?n[=C3=BAu]mero de\IBAN)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">032180000118359719</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065ff" class=3D"confluenceTh">Bank account n=
umber</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">CLABE</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ti=
tle=3D"Background color :">Credit card number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">(?i) (?:=
 tarjeta bancaria | n=C3=BAmero de tarjeta de cr=C3=A9dito | tarjeta de cr=
=C3=A9dito | tarjeta de cajero autom=C3=A1tico | tipo de tarjeta | n.=C2=B0=
 de tarjeta de cr=C3=A9dito | n=C3=BAmero de tarjeta de cr=C3=A9dito)</span=
></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Routing number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Mexico Routing Number matches a va=
lid routing number combined with any of the following keywords within a pro=
ximity of 10 terms: n=C3=BAmero de ruta, n.=C2=B0 de, n.=C2=B0 de ruta de, =
n=C3=BAmero de ruta de, n.=C2=B0 de ruta bancario, n.=C2=B0 de ruta (or) RT=
N.<span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3"> (All terms case insensitive; dia=
critics are optional.)</span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{9}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p style=3D"text-decoration: none;" class=3D"headline">Routing number</p></=
td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:n=C3=BAmero de ruta de|n\.?[o=C2=BA] de r=
uta bancario|n[=C3=BAu]mero de ruta|n\.?[o=C2=BA] de ruta de|n\.?[o=C2=BA] =
de ruta|n\.?[o=C2=BA] de|RTN)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><strong>Example:</strong></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">123456789</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065ff" class=3D"confluenceTh">Business numbe=
r</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">RFC number</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065ff" class=3D"confluenceTh">Company number=
</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">RFC number</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
