lid company number combined with any of the following keywords within a pro=
ximity of 10 terms: =D7=9E=D7=A1=D7=A4=D7=A8 =D7=97=D7=91=D7=A8=D7=94 (or) =
=D7=9E=D7=A1=D7=A4=D7=A8 =D7=97=D7=91=D7=A8=D7=94, =D7=9E=D7=A1=D7=A4=D7=A8=
 =D7=96=D7=99=D7=94=D7=95=D7=99 =D7=AA=D7=90=D7=92=D7=99=D7=93, =D7=9E=D7=
=A1=D7=A4=D7=A8 =D7=A8=D7=99=D7=A9=D7=95=D7=9D =D7=97=D7=91=D7=A8=D7=94, =
=D7=9E=D7=A1=D7=A4=D7=A8 =D7=AA=D7=90=D7=92=D7=99=D7=93</td>
