<h2 class=3D"auto-cursor-target" id=3D"Batch2Countries-Switzerland"><strong=
>Switzerland</strong></h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table class=3D"wrapped relative-table confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 144=
.378%;">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 4.54119%;">
<col style=3D"width: 12.8495%;">
<col style=3D"width: 47.9921%;">
<col style=3D"width: 34.6172%;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Identifiers</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Descriptions</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Regex</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Note</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Social Security Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"4" class=3D"confluenceTd">Switzerland Social Security Number=
 matches a valid SSN combined with any of the following keywords within a p=
roximity of 10 terms: Sozialversicherungs-Nr., Sozialversicherung, SV-Nr., =
SV-Nummer, Sozialversicherungsnummer, n=C2=BA de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 sociale=
#, # de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 sociale, SSN#, SSID (or) num=C3=A9ro de s=C3=A9c=
urit=C3=A9 sociale.&nbsp;(All terms case insensitive; diacritics are option=
al.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{3}[ .]?\d{4}[ .]?\d{4}[ .]?\d{2}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"4" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:Sozialversicherungs-Nr\.?|S=
ozialversicherung|SV-Nr\.?|SV-Nummer|Sozialversicherungsnummer|n[o=C2=BA] d=
e s[=C3=A9e]curit[=C3=A9e] sociale\#?|\#? de s[=C3=A9e]curit[=C3=A9e] socia=
le|SSN\#?|SSID|num[=C3=A9e]ro de s[=C3=A9e]curit[=C3=A9e] sociale)<span cla=
ss=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ti=
tle=3D"Background color :"><strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-default=
" title=3D"">Example:</span></strong></td>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-d=
efault">756.1234.5678.97</span></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">National Identity Card Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Switzerland National ID Number mat=
ches a valid National Identity Card Number combined with any of the followi=
ng keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: Personalausw., Personalausweisn=
ummer, Personalausweisnr., Identit=C3=A4tsausweis, Identit=C3=A4tsausweisnu=
mmer, Personalausweis, NIN#, num=C3=A9ro de carte d'identit=C3=A9, n=C2=BA =
de carte d'identit=C3=A9, num=C3=A9ro d'identification national, num=C3=A9r=
o de carte nationale d'identit=C3=A9 (or) carte d'identit=C3=A9. (All terms=
 case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-default">CHE[- =
. ]?\d{3}[- . ]?\d{3}[- . ]?\d{3}</span></td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:Personalausw\.?|Personalausweisnummer|Per=
sonalausweisnr\.?|Identit[=C3=A4a]tsausweis|Identit[=C3=A4a]tsausweisnummer=
|Personalausweis|NIN\#?|num[=C3=A9e]ro de carte d\'identit[=C3=A9e]|n[o=C2=
=BA] de carte d\'identit[=C3=A9e]|num[=C3=A9e]ro d\'identification national=
|num[=C3=A9e]ro de carte nationale d\'identit[=C3=A9e]|carte d\'identit[=C3=
=A9e])<span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$=
))</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">CHE123456789,CHE-123.456.789</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Central Provident Fund Number - CP=
F</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Switzerland Central Provident Fund=
 Number - CPF matches a valid CPF number combined with any of the following=
 keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: Vorsorgenummer, Vorsorge-Nummer, =
Zentrale Vorsorgekassennummer, Berufliche Vorsorgenummer, Berufliche Vorsor=
genr., Ident.-Nr., BV, ALV, KV, MUV#, code CPF, num=C3=A9ro CPF, num=C3=A9r=
o de caisse de pr=C3=A9voyance, num=C3=A9ro d'identification CPF, n=C2=BA d=
'identification CPF (or) ID CPF#. (All terms case insensitive; diacritics a=
re optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{3}[- .]?\d{3}[- .]?\d{3}[- .]?\d{2}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:Vorsorgenummer|Vorsorge-Nummer|Zentrale V=
orsorgekassennummer|Berufliche Vorsorgenummer|Berufliche Vorsorgenr\.?|Iden=
t\.?-Nr\.?|BV|ALV|KV|MUV\#?|code CPF|num[=C3=A9e]ro CPF|num[=C3=A9e]ro de c=
aisse de pr[=C3=A9e]voyance|num[=C3=A9e]ro d\'identification CPF|n[o=C2=BA]=
 d'identification CPF|ID CPF\#?)<span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">(?:=
\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">231.002.999-00</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Passport number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Switzerland Passport Number matche=
s a valid passport number combined with any of the following keywords withi=
n a proximity of 10 terms: Reisepass, Ausweis f=C3=BCr internationale Reise=
n, Passdetails, Visum, Nationaler Personalausweis, Reisedokument, Ausstellu=
ngsbeh=C3=B6rde, Identifizierung, Identit=C3=A4tsnachweis, Pass-Nr., Passnr=
., Reisepassnr., Reisepass-Nr., Reisepassnummer, Passnummer, Pass, pi=C3=A8=
ce d'identit=C3=A9 pour les d=C3=A9placements internationaux, informations =
relatives au passeport, visa, carte nationale d'identit=C3=A9, titre de voy=
age, autorit=C3=A9 de d=C3=A9livrance, identification, preuve d'identit=C3=
=A9, id de passeport, n=C2=BA de passeport, num=C3=A9ro de passeport (or) p=
asseport.&nbsp;(All terms case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-default">(CHE[-=
 ][A-z]{2}[- ]\d{5}|[A-Z]{2}\d{7}|[A-Z0-9]{8})</span></td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:Reisepass|Ausweis f[=C3=BCu]r internation=
ale Reisen|Passdetails|Visum|Nationaler Personalausweis|Reisedokument|Ausst=
ellungsbeh[=C3=B6o]rde|Identifizierung|Identit[=C3=A4a]tsnachweis|Pass-Nr\.=
?|Passnr\.?|Reisepassnr\.?|Reisepass-Nr\.?|Reisepassnummer|Passnummer|Pass|=
pi[=C3=A8e]ce d\'identit[=C3=A9e] pour les d[=C3=A9e]placements internation=
aux|informations relatives au passeport|visa|carte nationale d\'identit[=C3=
=A9e]|titre de voyage|autorit[=C3=A9e] de d[=C3=A9e]livrance|identification=
|preuve d\'identit[=C3=A9e]|id de passeport|n[o=C2=BA] de passeport|num[=C3=
=A9e]ro de passeport|passeport)<span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">(?:\=
b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-default">CHE-AO=
-03001,CH1234567,S1A00A00</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Driver License Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Switzerland Driver's License Numbe=
r matches a valid license number combined with any of the following keyword=
s within a proximity of 10 terms: Kraftfahrzeugzulassungsstelle, F=C3=BChre=
rschein, vorl=C3=A4ufiger F=C3=BChrerschein, F=C3=BChrerscheininhaberIn, F=
=C3=BChrerscheininhaberInnen, F=C3=BChrerscheinnummer, Fahrerlaubnisnummer,=
 F=C3=BChrerscheine, ANTS, permis de conduire avec photo, =C3=A9l=C3=A8ve c=
onducteur, d=C3=A9tenteurs du permis, d=C3=A9tenteur du permis, num=C3=A9ro=
 du permis, num=C3=A9ro du permis de conduire (or) permis de conduire.&nbsp=
;(All terms case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{10,12}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:Kraftfahrzeugzulassungsstelle|F[=C3=BCu]h=
rerschein|vorl[=C3=A4a]ufiger F[=C3=BCu]hrerschein|F[=C3=BCu]hrerscheininha=
berIn|F[=C3=BCu]hrerscheininhaberInnen|F[=C3=BCu]hrerscheinnummer|Fahrerlau=
bnisnummer|F[=C3=BCu]hrerscheine|ANTS|permis de conduire avec photo|[=C3=A9=
e]l[=C3=A8e]ve conducteur|d[=C3=A9e]tenteurs du permis|d[=C3=A9e]tenteur du=
 permis|num[=C3=A9e]ro du permis|num[=C3=A9e]ro du permis de conduire|permi=
s de conduire)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">000231268003,3494810123</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065ff" rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTh">=
Social Insurance Number - SIN</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Tax ID number (i.e. Taxpayer ID nu=
mber)</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Switzerland Tax ID Number matches =
a valid Tax Identification Number combined with any of the following keywor=
ds within a proximity of 10 terms: Steueridentifikationsnummer, Steuerident=
ifikations-Nr., Steuerakte, Steueridentifikationsnr., Steuernr., Steuerregi=
strierungsnr., Steuernummer, TIN, num=C3=A9ro d'identification fiscal, num=
=C3=A9ro identification fiscale, num=C3=A9ro d'identit=C3=A9 fiscale, num=
=C3=A9ro fiscal, Code d'identification fiscale, fichier fiscal, n=C2=BA d'i=
dentification fiscale, #n=C2=BA fiscal, n=C2=BA fiscal, num=C3=A9ro de regi=
stre fiscal, #idfiscal, #n=C2=BAidfiscal, #num=C3=A9roidfiscal, #n=C2=BAfis=
cal, #num=C3=A9rofiscal, num=C3=A9rofiscal, id nif, n=C2=BA nif, #nif, NIF =
(or) id fiscal. (All terms case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(756[ .]?\d{4}[ .]?\d{4}[ .]?\d{2}|CHE[-. ]?\d{3=
}[ .]?\d{3}[ .]?\d{3})</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:Steueridentifikationsnummer|Steueridentif=
ikations-Nr\.?|Steuerakte|Steueridentifikationsnr\.?|Steuernr\.?|Steuerregi=
strierungsnr\.?|Steuernummer|TIN|num[=C3=A9e]ro d\'identification fiscal|nu=
m[=C3=A9e]ro identification fiscale|num[=C3=A9e]ro d\'identit[=C3=A9e] fisc=
ale|num[=C3=A9e]ro fiscal|Code d\'identification fiscale|fichier fiscal|n[o=
=C2=BA] d\'identification fiscale|\#?n[o=C2=BA] fiscal|n[o=C2=BA] fiscal|nu=
m[=C3=A9e]ro de registre fiscal|\#?idfiscal|\#?n[o=C2=BA]idfiscal|\#?num[=
=C3=A9e]roidfiscal|\#?n[o=C2=BA]fiscal|\#?num[=C3=A9e]rofiscal|num[=C3=A9e]=
rofiscal|id nif|n[o=C2=BA] nif|\#?nif|NIF|id fiscal)<span class=3D"legacy-c=
olor-text-blue3">(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#])(?=3D\W|$))</span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">756.9217.0769.85,CHE-123.456.788</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">VAT number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Switzerland VAT ID Number matches =
a valid Value Added Tax Identification number combined with any of the foll=
owing keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: MwSt.-Nummer, Mehrwertsteuer=
-Identifikationsnummer, Mehrwertsteuernummer, Mehrwertsteuer-Nr., Umsatzste=
uer-Identifikationsnummer, MwSt., n=C2=BA TVA, num=C3=A9ro de TVA, TVA#, ta=
xe sur la valeur ajout=C3=A9e, num=C3=A9ro de taxe sur la valeur ajout=C3=
=A9e, n=C2=BA TVA (or) TVA. (All terms case insensitive; diacritics are opt=
ional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">CHE[-. ]?\d{3}[ .]?\d{3}[ .]?\d{3}[ .]?(IVA|MWST=
|TVA)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
