<h2 class=3D"auto-cursor-target" id=3D"Batch2Countries-Chile"><strong>Chile=
</strong></h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table class=3D"wrapped relative-table confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 97.=
4684%;">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 22.0183%;">
<col style=3D"width: 33.4862%;">
<col style=3D"width: 31.8043%;">
<col style=3D"width: 12.6911%;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Identifiers</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Descriptions</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Regex</th>
<th style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTh">Note</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065ff" class=3D"confluenceTh">Social Securit=
y Number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">National Identity Card Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Chile National ID Number - RUT (Ro=
l =C3=9Anico Tributario Number) matches a valid RUT number combined with an=
y of the following keywords within a proximity of 10 terms: NIN n.=C2=B0, n=
=C3=BAmero de tarjeta de identidad nacional, n=C3=BAmero de tarjeta naciona=
l, n=C3=BAmero de identificaci=C3=B3n nacional, Rol =C3=9Anico Tributario, =
RUT (or) identificaci=C3=B3n nacional. (All terms case insensitive; diacrit=
ics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(\d{8}\-\d{1}|(?!0)[\d]{2}[.]?\d{3}[.]?\d{3}\-[0=
-9Kk])</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><strong>RUT(Rol =C3=9Anico Tributario)</strong><=
/td>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:NIN\ n\.?[o=C2=B0]?|n[=C3=
=BAu]mero de identificaci[=C3=B3o]n nacional|n[=C3=BAu]mero de tarjeta de i=
dentidad nacional|n[=C3=BAu]mero de tarjeta nacional|identificaci[=C3=B3o]n=
 nacional|RUT|Rol =C3=9Anico Tributario)<span class=3D"legacy-color-text-bl=
ue3">(?:\b|(?&lt;=3D[.#=C2=B0])(?=3D\W|$))</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">12345678-9,12.345.678-K</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065ff" class=3D"confluenceTh">CPF number</th=
>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Passport number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Chile Passport Number matches a va=
lid passport number combined with any of the following keywords within a pr=
oximity of 10 terms: identificaci=C3=B3n para viajes internacionales, detal=
les del pasaporte, visa, documento de identidad nacional, n=C3=BAmero de pa=
saporte, documento de viaje, autoridad emisora, identificaci=C3=B3n, prueba=
 de identificaci=C3=B3n, ID de pasaporte (or) pasaporte.&nbsp;(All terms ca=
se insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-default">([A-Z]=
{2}\d{6}|[\d]{2}[.]?\d{3}[.]?\d{3}\-[0-9Kk])</span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:identificaci[=C3=B3o]n para=
 viajes internacionales|detalles del pasaporte|visa|documento de identidad =
nacional|n[=C3=BAu]mero de pasaporte|documento de viaje|autoridad emisora|i=
dentificaci[=C3=B3o]n|prueba de identificaci[=C3=B3o]n|ID de pasaporte|pasa=
porte)</td>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-d=
efault">AA123456,12.345.678-K</span></td>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Driver License Number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Chile Driver's License Number matc=
hes a valid license number combined with any of the following keywords with=
in a proximity of 10 terms: DVLA, licencia de tarjeta con foto, controlador=
es principiantes, titular de licencia, titulares de licencia, n=C3=BAmero d=
e licencia, licencias de conducir, licencia de conducir (or) licencia de co=
nductor.&nbsp;(All terms case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">(\d{8}|(?!0)[\d]{2}[.]?\d{3}[.]?\d{3}\-[0-9Kk])<=
/td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:DVLA|licencia de tarjeta co=
n foto|controladores principiantes|titular de licencia|titulares de licenci=
a|n[=C3=BAu]mero de licencia|licencias de conducir|licencia de conducir|lic=
encia de conductor)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">12.345.678-9</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065ff" class=3D"confluenceTh">Social Insuran=
ce Number - SIN</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Not aplicable but uses NIN</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065ff" class=3D"confluenceTh">Tax ID number =
(i.e. Taxpayer ID number)</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">NIN</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065ff" class=3D"confluenceTh">VAT number</th=
>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Same as RUT</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065ff" class=3D"confluenceTh">Health service=
 number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Same as RUT</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065ff" class=3D"confluenceTh">Health Insuran=
ce number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Same as RUT</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ti=
tle=3D"Background color :">Date of birth</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">(?i)(?:f=
echa de nacimiento|fecha de nacimiento|cumplea=C3=B1os|fecha de nacimiento|=
aniversario de nacimiento|d=C3=ADa de nacimiento|cumplea=C3=B1os|fecha de n=
acimiento)</span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Phone number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Chile Phone Number matches a valid=
 phone number combined with any of the following keywords within a proximit=
y of 10 terms: n=C3=BAmero de tel=C3=A9fono, n=C3=BAmero de tel=C3=A9fono m=
=C3=B3vil (or) n=C3=BAmero de m=C3=B3vil.&nbsp;(All terms case insensitive;=
 diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-default">(0056|=
\+56|56)[ ]?(\d{1}[ ]\d{4}[ ]\d{4}|\d{3}-\d{4}-\d{3})</span></td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:n[=C3=BAu]mero de tel[=C3=
=A9e]fono|n[=C3=BAu]mero de tel[=C3=A9e]fono m[=C3=B3o]vil|n[=C3=BAu]mero d=
e m[=C3=B3o]vil)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-d=
efault">'+56 9 9876 5432,+56 123-4567-890</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#de350b" class=3D"confluenceTh">Physical addre=
ss</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Post code</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Chile Postcode matches a valid pos=
tcode combined with any of the following keywords within a proximity of 10 =
terms: direcci=C3=B3n, distrito de c=C3=B3digo postal, =C3=A1rea de c=C3=B3=
digo postal, unidad de c=C3=B3digo postal (or) sector de c=C3=B3digo postal=
.&nbsp;(All terms case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{7}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:direcci[=C3=B3o]n|distrito =
de c[=C3=B3o]digo postal|[=C3=A1a]rea de c[=C3=B3o]digo postal|unidad de c[=
=C3=B3o]digo postal|sector de c[=C3=B3o]digo postal)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">7510777,1390000,4950000</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">License plate number (i.e. vehicle=
)</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Chile License Plate Number matches=
 a valid license plate number combined with any of the following keywords w=
ithin a proximity of 10 terms: n.=C2=B0 de registro, n.=C2=B0 de matr=C3=AD=
cula, n=C3=BAmero de licencia, n=C3=BAmero de matr=C3=ADcula n=C3=BAmero de=
 registro (or) matr=C3=ADcula.&nbsp;(All terms case insensitive; diacritics=
 are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-default">([A-Z]=
{1,3}\d{2,4}|[B-DF-HJ-LPRSTV-Z]{2}[- .][B-DF-HJ-LPRSTV-Z]{2}[- .]\d{2})</sp=
an></td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:n\.[o=C2=B0] de registro|n\=
.?[o=C2=B0] de matr[=C3=ADi]cula|n[=C3=BAu]mero de licencia|n[=C3=BAu]mero =
de matr[=C3=ADi]cula n[=C3=BAu]mero de registro|matr[=C3=ADi]cula)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-d=
efault">BB1234,VR5678,LL90,JTH86,BB-BB.10,BG-XY.46</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#de350b" class=3D"confluenceTh">Person name</t=
h>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065ff" class=3D"confluenceTh">IBAN</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">N/A</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Bank account number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Chile Bank Account Number matches =
a valid bank account number combined with any of the following keywords wit=
hin a proximity of 10 terms: n=C3=BAmero de cuenta bancaria, detalles banca=
rios, n=C3=BAmero de banco, c=C3=B3digo de cuenta, ID de cuenta, n=C3=BAmer=
o de cuenta (or) cuenta numerada.&nbsp;(All terms case insensitive; diacrit=
ics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{8,14}(-\d)?</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br><br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:n[=C3=BAu]mero de cuenta ba=
ncaria|detalles bancarios|n[=C3=BAu]mero de banco|c[=C3=B3o]digo de cuenta|=
ID de cuenta|n[=C3=BAu]mero de cuenta|cuenta numerada)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">1234567890,0987654321,87654321-9</=
td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"grey" ti=
tle=3D"Background color :">Credit card number</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">(?i)(?:t=
arjeta bancaria | n=C3=BAmero de tarjeta de cr=C3=A9dito | tarjeta de cr=C3=
=A9dito | tarjeta de cajero autom=C3=A1tico | tipo de tarjeta | n.=C2=BA de=
 tarjeta de cr=C3=A9dito | n.=C2=B0 de tarjeta de cr=C3=A9dito)</span></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th rowspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">Routing number</th>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Chile Routing Number matches a val=
id routing number combined with any of the following keywords within a prox=
imity of 10 terms: n.=C2=B0 de ruta de, n=C3=BAmero de ruta de, n=C3=BAmero=
 de ruta, n.=C2=B0 de ruta bancario, n.=C2=B0 de ruta, n. =C2=B0 de (or) RT=
N.&nbsp;(All terms case insensitive; diacritics are optional.)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">\d{9}</td>
<td rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTd">Routing number<br><br></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">(?i)(?:n\.?[o=C2=B0] de ruta de|n[=
=C3=BAu]mero de ruta de|n[=C3=BAu]mero de ruta|n\.?[o=C2=B0] de ruta bancar=
io|n\.?[o=C2=B0] de ruta|n\.? [o=C2=B0] de|RTN)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTh">Example:</th>
<td colspan=3D"1" class=3D"confluenceTd">066014085,026005652</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065ff" class=3D"confluenceTh">Business numbe=
r</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Same as RUT number</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#0065ff" class=3D"confluenceTh">Company number=
</th>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Same as RUT number</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
